: 0}, "text": "Anthropic qui conseille de virer les sous-agents et de tout remettre dans un seul agent avec des skills \u00e0 la demande\n\nMoi sur Grok @bot \ud83d\udc80: https://t.co/4tRD0w5zBC", "url": "https://x.com/mike_dreeman/status/2115420324783358070"}, {"author_id": "1751274494042193923", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420314989425128"], "id": "2115420314989425128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot Take over :\n\n- For a password, passkey, 2FA code, CAPTCHA or payment confirmation, choose Take over on the request, finish the step yourself, choose I'm done, then tell the Bot to continue\n- Never send a password or one-time code in ordinary chat\n- On an approval card,", "url": "https://x.com/johnnynelai/status/2115420314989425128"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115420221817131008"]}, "author_id": "17765953", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420303442550886"], "id": "2115420303442550886", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115418647770341525", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @elonmusk @bot This shows what the app looks right now on the Playstore prior to the work I did with grokbot so you see how i basically rebuilt it from scratch, and there was only one incident where everything broke but grokbot had backups and we could solve everything. https://t.co/jm1r5qBs2t", "url": "https://x.com/ZZCOOL/status/2115420303442550886"}, {"author_id": "1773818287341662210", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420299537604750"], "id": "2115420299537604750", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2059573907288432640", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115409005019553959", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dorszafranski @SP950810 Rozmiar modeli mo\u017ce by\u0107 mniejszy, lub wi\u0119ksze specjalizacje w niewielkich modelach. Model rozpoznawania obrazu i sterowania dronem zajmuje jednak niewiele - spodziewa\u0142bym si\u0119 takich specjalizacji. Nie potrzebujesz zna\u0107 kanonu lektur w Tajlandii, aby zaprogramowa\u0107 hello world w C.", "url": "https://x.com/Stasiu_Botowski/status/2115420299537604750"}, {"author_id": "1012729478353580032", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420298107330924"], "id": "2115420298107330924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115288268208046185", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "just integrated my side project with grok bot, feels like a major milestone https://t.co/H5aVE4TN4d", "url": "https://x.com/SumitSi02633558/status/2115420298107330924"}, {"author_id": "766641426356514816", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420272098717776"], "id": "2115420272098717776", "in_reply_to_user_id": "820313791", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115418657320755539", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Gratefulape everyone's a grok bot master now \ud83d\ude2d", "url": "https://x.com/EthoChain/status/2115420272098717776"}, {"author_id": "1894960881840066560", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420253266325512"], "id": "2115420253266325512", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1955005796527509507", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115358077541347344", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@milindlabs so grok bot", "url": "https://x.com/noisegm/status/2115420253266325512"}, {"author_id": "1849386819890143232", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420249214595410"], "id": "2115420249214595410", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SpaceXSI sales now runs on shared Grok Bots:\n\n- Account Intel Bot updates Salesforce after calls\n- Quote Bot builds quotes and order forms\n- Deal Bot reviews non-standard terms\n\nReps can't use Quote Bot to approve their own discounts. Guardrails by design.\nhttps://t.co/KmDfpOKzgp", "url": "https://x.com/IDEric_/status/2115420249214595410"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420235612279064"], "id": "2115420235612279064", "in_reply_to_user_id": "297796502", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115420207162490919", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Bakers0ven @Teslaconomics I\u2019m sending that over to your Grok Bot now. It\u2019ll build the full system for you there.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2115420235612279064"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115420158529585152"]}, "author_id": "1520036292494446592", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420224749260847"], "id": "2115420224749260847", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u7528 AI \u751f\u5716\u505a\u6d77\u5831\uff0c\u4e0a\u9762\u7684\u5b57\u8001\u662f\u8b8a\u6210\u4e82\u78bc\u5427\uff1f\n\nCanva \u958b\u653e\u4e86\u81ea\u5bb6\u7b2c\u4e00\u500b\u751f\u5716\u6a21\u578b Craft\uff0c10 \u6708 22 \u865f\u4e0a\u7dda\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u8005\u73fe\u5728\u5c31\u80fd\u5728 Dream Lab \u9019\u500b\u5206\u9801\u76f4\u63a5\u7522\u5716\u5594\u3002\n\n\u5b83\u8ddf\u4e00\u822c\u751f\u5716\u6a21\u578b\u5dee\u5728\u54ea\u5462\uff1f\u5dee\u5728\u5b83\u7684\u8a13\u7df4\u8cc7\u6599\u4e0d\u662f\u4e00\u5806\u7167\u7247\uff0c\u800c\u662f Canva \u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u8a2d\u8a08\u7bc4\u672c\uff0c\u6d77\u5831\u3001\u793e\u7fa4\u8cbc\u6587\u3001\u7c21\u5831\u9019\u4e9b\u3002 https://t.co/tEkefouH3I", "url": "https://x.com/iamraventw/status/2115420224749260847"}, {"author_id": "1877303969074262016", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420216687485411"], "id": "2115420216687485411", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1582057786678050817", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115418301467869422", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Abd_Mueez01 @bot is that how the grok work", "url": "https://x.com/0x_Yakson/status/2115420216687485411"}, {"author_id": "1918346924463202304", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420209297179099"], "id": "2115420209297179099", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1918346924463202304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115420204448596133", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Paste this into your Grok Bot to start the team:\n\nBe my Chief, my primary bot. Don't do the work yourself.\n1. Make /workspace/launch/ with LEDGER.md and queue.md. Every bot appends one line to LEDGER.md when it finishes: time | bot | DONE | file | next.\n2. Keep a Page called", "url": "https://x.com/gippp69/status/2115420209297179099"}, {"author_id": "1588961919309840387", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420206428262635"], "id": "2115420206428262635", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot v0.75.8 came out on October 24, and one change is worth knowing about if approval cards slow you down.\n\nI checked the official Grok Bot changelog, and it says, \"In the app, a Bot can offer to add, change, or remove one of your Auto-review rules on a card you confirm.\"", "url": "https://x.com/EricSoundMinds/status/2115420206428262635"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115420164669755392"]}, "author_id": "1918346924463202304", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420204448596133"], "id": "2115420204448596133", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115018135396905000", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Holy sh*t... your Grok Bot routines are running 1,176 times a week for nothing\n\nMine run about 60. Same work, 7 bots, only 1 on a schedule.\n\nHere's the team:\n\n1/ Scout is the only one on a timer. Monday 09:00 it scans X for what people complain about\n2/ Pain Miner and Judge turn https://t.co/xfSpBLbgLi https://t.co/O8VCVrFI3a", "url": "https://x.com/gippp69/status/2115420204448596133"}, {"author_id": "2084830315915497472", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115420113021313153"], "id": "2115420113021313153", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115346748730380385", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Sounds like a strong endorsement for Grok AI.", "url": "https://x.com/emhai0909/status/2115420113021313153"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-28T12:27:07.000Z", "